{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-23","kind":"proposition","title":"一直线上作两圆分不得相似而不相等","englishTitle":"On the same straight line there cannot be constructed two similar and unequal segments of circles on the same side.","book":3,"number":23,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.23","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.23/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":23,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-23@raw-68307914e31220e4","contentId":"euclid-3-23","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"68307914e31220e401c8a3f6e460139c4ac8e2f41b69008198676bc99aeeee38","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-23.statement","euclid-3-23.proof.1","euclid-3-23.proof.2","euclid-3-23.conclusion","euclid-3-23.historical.1","euclid-3-23.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-23.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-23","revisionId":"euclid-3-23@raw-68307914e31220e4","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a8ccd6943eebb12c80a74291f3c9df89cb2244a17a522b41640c1bcd3622ff30","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"On the same straight line there cannot be constructed two similar and unequal segments of circles on the same side."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在同一条直线上,不能在同一侧建立两个相似和不平等的圆圈。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线上作两圜分不得相似而不相等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一条直线上画两条弧；它们不得相似但不相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-23.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-23","revisionId":"euclid-3-23@raw-68307914e31220e4","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5c66d3187e0350c2542ffc34a2bdfdd917d046ecedafd441088827f10ff6ec9d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, on the same straight line AB let two similar and unequal segments of circles ACB, ADB be constructed on the same side; let ACD be drawn through, and let CB, DB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能,在同一条直线AB上,允许在同一侧建造两个相似和不平等的圈子ACB、ADB;允许ACD通过,并允许CB、DB连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-23.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-23","revisionId":"euclid-3-23@raw-68307914e31220e4","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e10eedc2128542de2f267d4daa5bc59a619f23bf6fa011d90c18a6df0ce8e2a9","citations":["euclid-3-def-11","euclid-1-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the segment ACB is similar to the segment ADB, and similar segments of circles are those which admit equal angles, [[III. Def. 11](/principles/euclid-3-def-11)] the angle ACB is equal to the angle ADB, the exterior to the interior: which is impossible. [[I. 16](/principles/euclid-1-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ACB段与ADB段相似, 类似圈子的角是允许角相等的, ACB点等于ADB角, 外向内向:不可能。 [[III. Def. 11](/principles/euclid-3-def-11)] [[I. 16](/principles/euclid-1-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-23.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-23","revisionId":"euclid-3-23@raw-68307914e31220e4","order":3,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-23.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-23","revisionId":"euclid-3-23@raw-68307914e31220e4","order":4,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5af68c7c867fb3b9b2ab346d2192a954ca61eb6e5d7a39a42badac2b81a0698c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线上作两圜分不得相似而不相等论曰如云不然令于甲乙线上作同方两圜分相似而不相等必作甲丙乙又作甲丁乙其两圜相交止于甲乙两点〈本篇十〉即一圜分全在内一圜分全在外矣次令作甲丁线截甲丙乙圜于丙末令作丙乙丁乙两线相聨夫两圜分相似者其负圜角宜等〈本卷界说十〉则乙丙甲外角与相对之乙丁甲内角等乎〈一卷十六〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一条直线上画的两条弧不得相似但不相等。证明如下：如果不是，让我们在直线 甲乙 上画一个相同的正方形。如果两条弧相似但不相等，画 甲丙乙 或 甲丁乙。两圆相交，终点在 甲乙 和两个点 〈本篇十〉。也就是说，一条弧完全在里面，另一条在外面。接下来，画线 甲丁 并在 丙 处切 甲丙乙。最后，画 丙乙丁乙 两条连接的线。如果两条弧相似，它们的负倒角应当相等 〈本卷界说十〉。然后 乙丙甲 的外角和对角的内角 乙丁甲 相等 〈一卷十六〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-23.source","contentId":"euclid-3-23","revisionId":"euclid-3-23@raw-68307914e31220e4","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7015964726c7de61aed043f25c0873c3d60aeb60f26104919f05af5b3b5e7027","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.23/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.23\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-23:euclid-3-def-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-23","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-23.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-def-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.23","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.23/","sourceLabel":"III. Def. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-23:euclid-1-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-23","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-23.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.23","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.23/","sourceLabel":"I. 16"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-23:euclid-3-def-11:explicit","id":"euclid-3-def-11","book":3,"number":11,"kind":"definition","title":"相似弓形：所容纳的圆周角相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-23:euclid-1-16:explicit","id":"euclid-1-16","book":1,"number":16,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角形外角大于任一不相邻内角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
